# Decorative loop for slide 4: beta-galactosidase density simulated from PDB 6CVM (molmap 6 A), one full turn.
# 360 frames at 1 deg/frame -> seamless 12 s loop at 30 fps. Run: chimerax --nogui --offscreen --exit bgal_spin.cxc
cd /home/ditsa/cryo-ai-seminar-data/sim
open 6cvm
molmap #1 6 gridSpacing 1.5
hide #1 models
set bgColor #0B1620
lighting soft
material dull
graphics silhouettes true width 2 color #0B1620
volume #2 style surface color #9FB4C2
volume #2 color #8FB8CC
view
turn x -60
view
movie record size 720,720 supersample 3
turn y 1 360
wait 360
movie stop
movie encode /home/ditsa/cryo-ai-seminar-data/sim/bgal-spin_raw.mp4 framerate 30 quality highest
